00:31:52,600 --> 00:32:03,000
We sang this song together as the last song at the Kacho Fugetsu concert,

496
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:09,520
From the beginning of the solo part, I was standing in a pose,

497
00:32:09,520 --> 00:32:14,320
My team was the first to sing with Ms. FUKUMURA,

498
00:32:14,320 --> 00:32:21,820
My team started with Ms. Fukumura's warm voice, and I stood there listening to the lyrics the whole time.

499
00:32:21,820 --> 00:32:29,000
Gradually, more and more songs were assigned, and we were all singing the lyrics together,

500
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:37,000
When I was singing the lyrics, I was with myself more than anyone else, thinking about myself,

501
00:32:37,000 --> 00:32:48,440
I chose this lyric because it was a moment when I felt I had to believe in myself, even if I was scared or something.

502
00:32:50,940 --> 00:32:52,940
It was a really good song.

503
00:32:52,940 --> 00:32:56,740
I was most impressed by it in iWISH.

504
00:32:56,740 --> 00:32:59,040
I think so too.

505
00:32:59,040 --> 00:33:08,260
This song is supposed to be kind, bright, and happy,

506
00:33:08,260 --> 00:33:15,160
I really like the way it makes you feel a bit lonely,

507
00:33:15,160 --> 00:33:21,560
It's not like everyone else is there, but rather, it's about taking care of yourself,

508
00:33:21,560 --> 00:33:26,560
I think it is a wonderful song because it is about taking care of people,

509
00:33:26,560 --> 00:33:29,060
The lyrics are also wonderful.

510
00:33:29,060 --> 00:33:31,360
I think the lyrics are very beautiful.

511
00:33:31,360 --> 00:33:33,660
You might be wearing earphones or something,

512
00:33:33,660 --> 00:33:36,860
I think these lyrics are very touching when you are alone,

513
00:33:36,860 --> 00:33:42,760
I think it is a good song to listen to alone.

514
